<BaseLayout title="About Pocketey Japan" description="About Pocketey Japan and our editorial approach."><section class="container simple"><div class="kicker">About Pocketey</div><h1 class="display">Japan travel information,<br/>without the clutter.</h1><div class="copy"><p>Pocketey Japan is an independent travel information project for international visitors. We focus on changes in Japan that can affect a trip — transportation, rules, seasonal events, disruptions and practical travel details.</p><h2>Our editorial approach</h2><p>We aim to answer three questions: What changed? Why does it matter to a traveler? What should you do next? Whenever possible, important claims should be checked against official or primary sources before publication.</p><h2>AI-assisted, human-approved</h2><p>Pocketey may use AI tools to assist with research, translation, drafting and editing. Every published article should receive human review before going live. AI assistance is not a substitute for source verification.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.simple{padding:85px 0 120px}.simple h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,8vw,7.5rem);margin:.5rem 0 2.8rem}.copy{max-width:760px;margin-left:auto}.copy p{font-size:1.03rem;color:#44463f}.copy h2{font:400 2rem Georgia;margin-top:2.5rem}</style>
